      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image_before": "shopify://shop_images/landing-1_17402013-bcf7-4e27-85d6-481b6a4f216b.png",
            "image_after": "shopify://shop_images/landing-2_28446b53-5f11-4284-86c8-541b3431b402.png",
            "name": "Sarah, 42",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“For years I bought the wrong foundation. It was either too orange or it settled into every wrinkle. With the Changing Foundation Stick, that's finally a thing of the past. It adapts perfectly to my skin tone and looks just as good in daylight as it does in the mirror. My skin looks much fresher and smoother – without looking cakey. For me, it's an absolute game-changer!”</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image_before": "shopify://shop_images/landing-3_e38fdf26-94d4-4f75-a8e4-d28a222b2dae.png",
            "image_after": "shopify://shop_images/landing-4_1b490eef-6c33-48b5-bd2e-d0f280e8a659.png",
            "name": "Monica, 52",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I have sensitive, dry skin and almost every foundation I've used has felt tight or settled under my eyes. This stick is completely different. It blends right into the skin and feels super light. In the evening, my face still looks natural – no orange tint, no settling into fine lines. I won't use any other foundation anymore.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image_before": "shopify://shop_images/landing-5_fd939f78-ba9e-4f3b-bc41-8ececeede260.png",
            "image_after": "shopify://shop_images/landing-6_d151b014-5bba-42e0-816a-eef0d3d27773.png",
            "name": "Claudia, 38",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I was incorrectly matched three times in the store and was just frustrated. The Changing Foundation Stick comes out white – at first I thought it wouldn't work. But when blended, it adapts perfectly to my tone. No visible line on my neck, no oxidation. My pigment spots are covered and yet it looks like my own skin.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image_before": "shopify://shop_images/landing-7_595ec7bf-14a3-49d7-9b68-2e62ac2bc7fd.png",
            "image_after": "shopify://shop_images/landing-8_f5e8e19c-a05e-4238-9817-2113f68667fc.png",
            "name": "Pamela, 67",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“At 67, I honestly thought foundation was no longer for me. Too heavy, too dry, too much. This stick is different – creamy, light, and it doesn't settle into my fine lines. My skin looks more even, and I'm getting compliments again. I never thought makeup could feel this good again.”</p>"
          }
        }
      },
