    "faq": {
      "type": "landing-faq",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
        "columns_desktop": "2",
        "item_color": "#F7F7F7",
        "padding-block-start": 40,
        "padding-block-end": 40
      },
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can one stick match so many different skin tones?",
            "answer": "<p>The Changing Foundation Stick doesn't contain just one fixed shade. It uses adaptive pigment technology that activates as you blend, so the color adjusts to your natural skin tone for a seamless-looking match.</p><p>Unlike traditional foundations that require choosing from dozens of shades, the formula gradually adapts during application, helping reduce visible lines between your face and neck.</p><p>For the best results:</p><ul><li>Blend longer for deeper skin tones.</li><li>Blend less for lighter skin tones.</li><li>Build coverage gradually as needed.</li></ul><p>The Changing Foundation Stick is best suited for light to medium skin tones.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the Changing Foundation Stick work?",
            "answer": "<p>The secret lies in intelligent pigment capsules. The stick goes on as a creamy, white base — the perfect neutral canvas. As you blend (with the integrated brush or your fingers), the pigment capsules burst open and adapt to your skin tone.</p><p>At the same time, the formula — enriched with hyaluronic acid, aloe vera and nourishing ingredients — supports mature skin by:</p><ul><li>smoothing the appearance of fine lines</li><li>hydrating</li><li>preventing dryness and settling into fine lines</li></ul><p>Simply blend until the tone matches and a natural, healthy glow emerges. No primer needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What finish does the foundation have?",
            "answer": "<p>Natural, with a gentle glow. Never flat. Never greasy. Never heavy. Simply your skin — only smoother, fresher, more even.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it last?",
            "answer": "<p>Tested on mature skin, the Changing Foundation Stick lasts up to 24 hours — without settling into lines or oxidizing. No color change by midday. No orange tones. No creasing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it suitable for everyday use?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. The formula was developed to work with mature skin every day — not against it.</p><ul><li>Lasting hydration</li><li>Reduced visible redness</li><li>Softened lines</li><li>All-day comfort</li><li>Lightweight feel</li><li>No clogged pores</li></ul><p>Feels like skincare — with coverage.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it suitable for sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The Facelove Changing Foundation Stick is gently formulated and suitable for mature and sensitive skin. It is free from harsh ingredients that can dry out or irritate the skin and contains soothing components such as aloe vera.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the most important ingredients?",
            "answer": "<p>Squalane, Diisostearyl Malate, CI 77891, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Tocopheryl Acetate, Phytosteryl Oleate, Madecassoside, Ceramide NP, CI 77492, CI 77491, CI 77499.</p>"
